[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 300.31, "timestamp": "00:05:00", "text": "誕生日の"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 304.07, "timestamp": "00:05:04", "text": "祈りとかをしていた時に、いつも思い出すことになるんです。 皆それぞれ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 307.27, "timestamp": "00:05:07", "text": "自分の道を進んでいて、私もそこへ行った。 ああ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 310.629, "timestamp": "00:05:10", "text": "、本当に面白かった。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 312.96, "timestamp": "00:05:12", "author": "@AFroznThorn", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/UOd53-ssefezO2JWGQi-gSpM4zglLHS2XVfc2UQu3E-TdNk2KGnAZtWYAYqQBudbEouoIqf3=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "🥳🥳🎉🎉"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 314.87, "timestamp": "00:05:14", "text": "そして私はもたついた。 祈りを捧げている最中に、舌を噛んでしまいました"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 319.11, "timestamp": "00:05:19", "text": "。   いろいろな"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 321.99, "timestamp": "00:05:21", "text": "ことが起こった。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 323.67, "timestamp": "00:05:23", "text": "ああ、本当にたくさんのことがありました"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 326.31, "timestamp": "00:05:26", "text": "。 うん。 今日、この番組をご覧になっている"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 328.469, "timestamp": "00:05:28", "text": "皆さんにお知らせです。今日は私の"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 328.793, "timestamp": "00:05:28", "author": "@ValikValik-b2u", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/C1JlkVEJDh0gzPP-LdyE6_0Cuq4eR-MdZKt5LYRqiusVebnNifrMX_s9qVS2ETVv0k1Wm_QHKg=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "🎉🎉🎉🎉🎉🥳"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 330.863, "timestamp": "00:05:30", "author": "@KonztellionHelper", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/GocLQxiJeUhcpFBwOECdYbCqbqHlCvz1B8j2gnfHQ1Q3AM1kFQ-eKqoi6TpMpyuxId3-6U94bcI=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "Greetings Konzteller! Valik_Evpiq~🌟 Welcome to the Guild! Make sure to read the Guildmate Guidelines in the description below before chatting further. Enjoy your stay!"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 332.629, "timestamp": "00:05:32", "text": "誕生日です。 今日は私の特別な日です。 えっと、xx x x"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 336.95, "timestamp": "00:05:36", "text": "x x x x 歳です。   私は年を取った"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 340.55, "timestamp": "00:05:40", "text": "。 ええ、私も年を取りました"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 342.07, "timestamp": "00:05:42", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 343.83, "timestamp": "00:05:43", "text": "私は年を取りたくない。 私は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 346.15, "timestamp": "00:05:46", "text": "永遠に80歳でいたい。だって、私は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 349.59000000000003, "timestamp": "00:05:49", "text": "星座なんだから。 私は歳を取らない。 でも、そうだけど、それでもね"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 351.67, "timestamp": "00:05:51", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 355.029, "timestamp": "00:05:55", "text": "では、今日は、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 358.15, "timestamp": "00:05:58", "text": "皆さんが送ってくれた誕生日のお祝いメッセージを読み上げます"}]